### Create Article Warehouse Cron Job
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/sync-config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "b41e3222-7b2b-4a63-967d-c1eebe05612a",
  "providerConfigId": "73b29d9b-054a-448f-b7c5-c0f3cac2b7fa",
  "syncType": "ARTICLE_WAREHOUSE",
  "enabled": true,
  "intervalSeconds": 600,
  "options": {
    "warehouseCode": "1"
  }
}

### Check all crons for organization
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/sync-config/b41e3222-7b2b-4a63-967d-c1eebe05612a

### Toggle cron active status (replace {id})
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/v1/sync-config/{id}/toggle

### Update interval (replace {id})
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/v1/sync-config/{id}/interval
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalSeconds": 600
}

### Trigger manual sync (replace {id})
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/sync-config/{id}/trigger

### View execution logs (replace {id})
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/sync-config/{id}/logs
